Standard Git ignore file for Visual Studio and .NET Core projects

--------------------

1. Project & Build Outputs

--------------------

Binaries for the compiled source code

[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

Output from dotnet publish

[Pp]ublish/

Test results

[Tt]est[Rr]esult/

--------------------

2. Visual Studio Specific Files

--------------------

Visual Studio user-specific files

*.user
*.suo

Visual Studio temporary solution files

*.tmp

Solution user options (often contains local settings)

*.vsscc
*.vspscc
*.vssscc

Visual Studio's hidden, temporary solution folder

This is what caused your "Permission denied" error.

.vs/

Generated migration file backups

..bak

--------------------

3. Third-Party Tools & Package Caches

--------------------

NuGet packages cache

.nuget/

NuGet folder for restoring packages (for older projects)

[Pp]ackages/

Editor settings file

.editorconfig

--------------------

4. Operating System Files

--------------------

Thumbs.db (Windows file explorer cache)

Thumbs.db

macOS specific files

.DS_Store

--------------------

5. Angular Frontend (node_modules)

--------------------

Node package dependencies (large and generated)

cms-frontend/node_modules/

Angular build output

cms-frontend/dist/